/// System-app example — an app that runs only inside a tenant, invoked by
/// other apps' DAG nodes, with no marketplace card.
///
/// `type = "system"` switches the contract into system-app mode:
/// `marketplaceCard` and `hasCredentialConfig` default to `false`, and
/// `atlan.yaml` carries no `entrypoints` block, so no card can be expanded
/// from it. Without a `uiConfig` there is no setup form, workflow configmap,
/// `manifest.json` or `_input.py` either: the callers' DAGs start the app.
///
/// Hiding the app's own listing is not the contract's job. A Global
/// Marketplace admin sets `is_system_app` on the GM App row once.
amends "../../src/App.pkl"

name = "system-app"
displayName = "System App Example"
icon = "https://assets.atlan.com/assets/ph-gear-light.svg"
type = "system"
